  it. A blank line had split it off.
- src/api/endpoints.ts and src/hooks/useSheetColumns.ts: the comments no longer say the columns
  route is missing. The code is unchanged. It still falls back on a 404 from an older server.

Comments and docs only. The phone already shows data.title and data.body as the server sends
them, so the new text and the company names need no app change.

